---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Live In Oakridge | Justin Skrypnyk Real Estate Broker"
  description="Privacy policy for liveinoakridge.ca — how Justin Skrypnyk, Real Estate Broker, collects, uses, and protects your personal information."
  noindex
>
  <section class="bg-navy py-16 text-white">
    <div class="container-site max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <div class="gold-divider mb-4"></div>
      <p class="text-white/60 text-sm">Last updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 bg-cream">
    <div class="container-site max-w-3xl">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-10 shadow-card prose prose-slate max-w-none">
        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit a contact form, newsletter signup, or home evaluation request on this website, we collect the information you provide — including your name, email address, phone number, and any message content.</p>

        <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Information you provide is used solely to respond to your inquiry and provide real estate services. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

        <h2>Cookies & Analytics</h2>
        <p>This website uses cookies and analytics tools to understand how visitors find and use the site. This may include anonymized usage data such as pages viewed, time on site, and referral source.</p>
        <p>We also measure, on our own website only, where on a page visitors click, how long each part of a page is on screen, and how far down a page visitors scroll. This is used to improve the site's layout. It does not record what you type into forms, and it isn't linked to your name or email address. It is not shared with anyone else. It is turned off if your browser sends a "Do Not Track" signal.</p>
        <p>When you send us a form, we include a short summary of your earlier visits to this website with it, such as how you first found the site, how many times you've visited, and how many listings you've viewed, so we can follow up in a way that's actually helpful. That summary is kept in your own browser until you choose to send a form, and it never includes anything you've typed elsewhere on the site.</p>
        <p>If you've sent us a form, or you arrive through a link in one of our emails, we may note when you come back to the website and which pages and listings you look at, so we can follow up with homes that fit what you're looking for. If you'd rather we didn't, just reply to any of our emails or contact us and we'll stop.</p>

        <h2>Advertising Pixels & Remarketing</h2>
        <p>This website uses the Meta Pixel (Facebook Pixel), a tracking technology provided by Meta Platforms, Inc. The Meta Pixel may collect information about your visit — such as pages viewed and actions taken — and use it to deliver relevant advertising on Facebook, Instagram, and related platforms. This is used for remarketing purposes only. You can opt out of interest-based advertising through your Facebook ad preferences or visit <a href="https://www.youradchoices.ca" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">youradchoices.ca</a>.</p>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>This website uses Google Maps embeds for neighbourhood location information. It also uses OpenStreetMap and the Nominatim geocoding service (operated by the OpenStreetMap Foundation) to power interactive maps and address-based tools such as the commute time calculator — if you enter an address into one of these tools, it is sent to Nominatim to look up its location. Please review Google's Privacy Policy and the <a href="https://osmfoundation.org/wiki/Privacy_Policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenStreetMap Foundation's Privacy Policy</a> for information on how they handle data. Lead inquiries submitted through contact forms on this website may be followed up via email or phone.</p>

        <h2>Data Security</h2>
        <p>We take reasonable steps to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, use, or disclosure.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy or how we handle your information, please contact Justin Skrypnyk at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> or {SITE.phoneDisplay}.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
